

Testing 
pip install -r requirements.txt
python ingest.py  # loading the data 
streamlit run streamlit_app.py



Production release 
docker compose up --build -d

WeUI endpoint
http://localhost:8501



Addition command:

curl -X POST http://localhost:8000/query -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{"question": "What is the main finding of the paper?"}'

Start API
uvicorn app:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000 --workers 1